atvians will elect a new parliament with Russia looming large over the campaign. Security fears dominate the agenda, but so does a debate over the economic cost of cutting ties with Moscow.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>Ethiopia and Eritrea sever ties amid Tigray fighting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6cb8359a2435dd42956bb1db4472f39a62a33e7ce555bb1bd077565a6fad6c7f</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:07:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T16:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-and-eritrea-sever-ties-amid-tigray-fighting/a-79507052--be67a180cf49.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-and-eritrea-sever-ties-amid-tigray-fighting/a-79507052?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ethiopia said it was expelling Eritrean diplomats in response to Eritrea's "direct and indirect acts of hostility." Eritrea said it had "no choice but to reciprocate in kind."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>After 2 years in office, how has Claudia Sheinbaum changed Mexico?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9e8b748e0db9c3dd4d52c6ec0536838c48a8f2a98cacf5911067539c7c07b182</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:07:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T16:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/after-2-years-in-office-how-has-claudia-sheinbaum-changed-mexico/a-79506055--8dcb67cbfaaf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/after-2-years-in-office-how-has-claudia-sheinbaum-changed-mexico/a-79506055?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two years after taking office as Mexico's first female president, Claudia Sheinbaum can take credit for a lower homicide rate and improved social benefits. But violence and corruption persist.</summary><category term="TOP STORIES" /></entry><entry><title>Ethiopia: Who could bring the warring sides to the negotiation table?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4f8afc65f2e70e6770442dc6ece640bff28a22809fe059a09b5cda51cd3d8a89</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:07:49Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T16:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-who-could-bring-the-warring-sides-to-the-negotiation-table/a-79475529--2936c02781db.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ethiopia-who-could-bring-the-warring-sides-to-the-negotiation-table/a-79475529?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ethiopia might be facing its most complex armed conflict in contempary times. The fragile 2022 peace deal has collapsed. International mediators have failed. How will the country manage to return to normal?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Finland probes suspected break-ins at politicians' homes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:91863cbc004aadc8cc1c63f118e31938ca35159cfa083b15bfb71ae9f0572177</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:07:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T15:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/finland-probes-suspected-break-ins-at-politicians-homes/a-79506236--10564686255b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/finland-probes-suspected-break-ins-at-politicians-homes/a-79506236?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Finnish prime minister has not ruled out the possibility of foreign involvement in the suspected break-ins at the homes of members of parliament.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Renee Good's family sues Trump admin over fatal ICE shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e3c4a3fabd677cd9973a3132c48490c2dde0b21db5cb48d370843ffe7c0045bf</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T14:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/renee-good-s-family-sues-trump-admin-over-fatal-ice-shooting/a-79504836--3b01ab91c959.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/renee-good-s-family-sues-trump-admin-over-fatal-ice-shooting/a-79504836?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The family of Renee Good, one of two US citizens fatally shot by federal immigration agents in Minneapolis in January, has sued President Donald Trump's administration alleging negligence and civil rights violations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany expresses optimism over Montenegro's EU ambitions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:396af1ac07c48385684804071048766ed393a3feb3c9279ba6f036c498b589ee</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T14:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-expresses-optimism-over-montenegro-s-eu-ambitions/a-79504069--d7fc739855e1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-expresses-optimism-over-montenegro-s-eu-ambitions/a-79504069?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's top diplomat said Montenegro has made "remarkable progress" in the accession process. The small Balkan state is being seen as a frontrunner among six regional candidates.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North and South Korea trade accusations over landmines that injured three soldiers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:294f2dcca33b1e14e0d52d12d705f0f8b2c02dffb020bdd114dc275bc6062082</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T13:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-and-south-korea-trade-accusations-over-landmines-that-injured-three-soldiers/a-79503854--57b9ec347358.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-and-south-korea-trade-accusations-over-landmines-that-injured-three-soldiers/a-79503854?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A mine blast that injured three South Korean soldiers has renewed scrutiny of North Korea's actions along the border and raised questions about its strategic goals.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Zimbabwe tycoon Wicknell Chivayo dies in helicopter crash</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f49cee793ed657edac0c49081139598fd2ec62e92aa16eebd05f3786edc1a1b5</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T13:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/zimbabwe-tycoon-wicknell-chivayo-dies-in-helicopter-crash/a-79501691--7a89acb12ffe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/zimbabwe-tycoon-wicknell-chivayo-dies-in-helicopter-crash/a-79501691?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Zimbabwe's President Emmerson Mnangagwa has confirmed the death of businessman Wicknell Chivayo and his wife in a helicopter crash, calling the high-rollers with a lavish lifestyle "consummately philanthropic."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump unveils South Korean investment in US energy projects</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b1ffc7e71370885fdb7d65e6535f4c7d1f5b9a2adad93b09799919b7c26ccee3</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T13:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-unveils-south-korean-investment-in-us-energy-projects/a-79502998--c02d83badb6a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-unveils-south-korean-investment-in-us-energy-projects/a-79502998?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump said South Korea has agreed to invest in an LNG project in Alaska, but Seoul has said it will only proceed once certain conditions are met.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>A brutal assault reignites fears over women's safety in India</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1d872a593fb8c173c219c05ff47b89d2851cd781c03782243e05d4ca3f30b4ce</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/a-brutal-assault-reignites-fears-over-women-s-safety-in-india/a-79501471--bceecddefb45.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/a-brutal-assault-reignites-fears-over-women-s-safety-in-india/a-79501471?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A string of sexual assault cases has revived questions about women's safety in India, fuelling fear, protests and demands for action.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Weakened US fuel-efficiency rules and promises of cheaper cars could see drivers pay higher running costs while also increasing carbon emissions.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e5d242d4a20e2f5831f906861ae162ec018668333384f684fea421758e949b01</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T11:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/weakened-us-fuel-efficiency-rules-and-promises-of-cheaper-cars-could-see-drivers-pay-higher-running-/a-79496554--0804b7619722.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/weakened-us-fuel-efficiency-rules-and-promises-of-cheaper-cars-could-see-drivers-pay-higher-running-costs-while-also-increasing-carbon-emissions/a-79496554?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Weakened US fuel-efficiency rules and promises of cheaper cars could yet see drivers pay higher running costs while increasing planet-heating emissions.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>UAE launches Flydubai hijacking and terrorism investigation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:efa0de99c622b3b2d036087e5afe12fdc7b22e38bb0e33a13f0a061433760b61</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T10:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uae-launches-flydubai-hijacking-and-terrorism-investigation/a-79497746--17ff1e197de5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uae-launches-flydubai-hijacking-and-terrorism-investigation/a-79497746?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The UAE's chief prosecutor said it's looking at the possibility of "terrorist activity or intent" in the alleged attempted hijacking of a Flydubai commercial flight to Tel Aviv. It says it has jurisdiction in the case.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germans' biggest fear is the high cost of living, an annual study finds</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6924d5f05b2abccfbc3cef939d7410caaa7c2f93e8b567ce3cb68be808ff3e31</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T09:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germans-biggest-fear-is-the-high-cost-of-living-an-annual-study-finds/a-79497762--40495e454721.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germans-biggest-fear-is-the-high-cost-of-living-an-annual-study-finds/a-79497762?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">What do Germans fear most in 2026? Wars? Global crises? Wrong. Their biggest concern is the cost of living, which keeps rising.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan launches deadly airstrikes on Afghanistan</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8aeea4d3f5d6fc11595984b0d4f340d92eff247f16500b05e3af056b8be60d9d</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T09:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistan-launches-deadly-airstrikes-on-afghanistan/a-79498092--42bd1620b7f6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistan-launches-deadly-airstrikes-on-afghanistan/a-79498092?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Taliban government in Afghanistan said at least nine civilians were killed in Pakistani airstrikes on two provinces overnight. Pakistan said it had struck militant hideouts, killing 22 fighters.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cristiano Ronaldo walks out of Portugal camp</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:54ee874b70d5b1d6427f7ef743962b3de8ed952f6f87f1ff9af0ecd05611c538</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T08:25:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cristiano-ronaldo-walks-out-of-portugal-camp/a-79497238--be4e02847569.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cristiano-ronaldo-walks-out-of-portugal-camp/a-79497238?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cristiano Ronaldo has left Portugal’s camp after learning that he would not start the next Nations League match. Portugal's coach has denied reports of a rift between himself and the star player.</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>Tennessee halts woman's execution after 'failed' attempt</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cd62ae513829c441788003726ab3e2f809f298c6156cf2e3fc8974e8947f7b7f</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T07:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tennessee-halts-woman-s-execution-after-failed-attempt/a-79496561--90352fa2ac40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tennessee-halts-woman-s-execution-after-failed-attempt/a-79496561?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Christa Pike was found alive and snoring, despite being administered two injections of a lethal drug. The state governor has ordered a review of the botched execution.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Merz lauds NATO with Westphalian Peace Prize</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4b09154b7da419ee26b53796537c887b324f717143d89b14e79cb9a3245a132d</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:07:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T06:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-lauds-nato-with-westphalian-peace-prize/live-79496180--2a3d5eea8753.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-lauds-nato-with-westphalian-peace-prize/live-79496180?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At a ceremony to honor NATO, the German chancellor warned that Russia will threaten the rest of Europe if it isn't stopped in Ukraine. In other news, the German military will set up its first drone regiment. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Swiss glaciers lose more than 5% in ice volume in 2026</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2526affc1583fb699d7700ed5dd21c68638a7e0268d4756da4f05a73a2c75a9c</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T03:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/swiss-glaciers-lose-more-than-5-in-ice-volume-in-2026/a-79495965--ebd2291f40e2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/swiss-glaciers-lose-more-than-5-in-ice-volume-in-2026/a-79495965?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Over the last five years, Swiss glaciers have lost nearly 20% of their mass, and 2026 saw the second-biggest loss of glacier volume on record. Experts warn there could be no ice left in the next 10-15 years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US military cuts generals, admirals by 20%, Hegseth says</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b5aea675a20d508b04ba2346e1684a04fd34e76dcdfdff3d857895d0a036f547</id><updated>2026-10-01T21:06:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T01:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-military-cuts-generals-admirals-by-20-hegseth-says/a-79495683--79e31e8a192e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-military-cuts-generals-admirals-by-20-hegseth-says/a-79495683?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US defense secretary has also unveiled major changes, including a new drone command and an Elon Musk-led task force to assess the future of warfare.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
